✨ Bringing Art to Code – My Tribute to the Thousand-Hand Dance ✨
Inspired by Thailand’s “Thousand-Hand Dance”, I recreated its rhythm & grace through code using HTML, CSS, JS, Bootstrap, GSAP, and SVG.
https://www.nakireddi.com/Thai_Dancer_Project/index.html
